    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/20d298352117a8163291e4e9c52ef9e7.avif?t=1751792722\" width=800 height=200 /></span><strong><i>Welcome to Unknown TD!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unknown TD</strong> is a <strong>Tower defense</strong> game, with multiple interesting features in the works, we're happy to provide fun semi-casual game for you to enjoy! With a handful of maps and towers along with a <strong>hero tower</strong> for the player to play around with.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/b31172be9d6457ce3c397bb8c33143a4.poster.avif?t=1751792722\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/b31172be9d6457ce3c397bb8c33143a4.webm?t=1751792722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/b31172be9d6457ce3c397bb8c33143a4.mp4?t=1751792722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The hero tower</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hero tower</strong> has a lot of customisation coming to it in future updates, not only limited to pistols, flamethrowers and sun glasses, but a wide array of cosmetics, weapons and abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game also features...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/af40b912c342ad40c55e6ac26f772598.avif?t=1751792722\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unique and ... interesting ... towers!</i></strong><br><strong>Unknown TD</strong> has (finally) got a good selection of (yet again) very<strong> unique</strong> and<strong><i>\u00a0interesting</i></strong>\u00a0towers. Some more practical, some more chaotic and others more Dinghy-tower-like (<strong><i>interesting</i></strong>) than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The game is currently in an unfinished state, with plenty more content to come in the form of gamemodes, towers, maps, hero equipment and much much more. Enjoy the (for now) <strong>early access</strong> game! <br>  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/20d298352117a8163291e4e9c52ef9e7.avif?t=1751792722\" width=800 height=200 /></span><strong><i>Welcome to Unknown TD!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unknown TD</strong> is a <strong>Tower defense</strong> game, with multiple interesting features in the works, we're happy to provide fun semi-casual game for you to enjoy! With a handful of maps and towers along with a <strong>hero tower</strong> for the player to play around with.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/b31172be9d6457ce3c397bb8c33143a4.poster.avif?t=1751792722\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/b31172be9d6457ce3c397bb8c33143a4.webm?t=1751792722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/b31172be9d6457ce3c397bb8c33143a4.mp4?t=1751792722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The hero tower</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hero tower</strong> has a lot of customisation coming to it in future updates, not only limited to pistols, flamethrowers and sun glasses, but a wide array of cosmetics, weapons and abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game also features...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/af40b912c342ad40c55e6ac26f772598.avif?t=1751792722\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unique and ... interesting ... towers!</i></strong><br><strong>Unknown TD</strong> has (finally) got a good selection of (yet again) very<strong> unique</strong> and<strong><i>\u00a0interesting</i></strong>\u00a0towers. Some more practical, some more chaotic and others more Dinghy-tower-like (<strong><i>interesting</i></strong>) than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The game is currently in an unfinished state, with plenty more content to come in the form of gamemodes, towers, maps, hero equipment and much much more. Enjoy the (for now) <strong>early access</strong> game! <br>  </p>",
